    {
      "id": "import",
      "title": "Import",
      "members": [],
      "paragraphs": [
        "Makes a node block light for as long as it is in an active scene.",
        "```ts wall.addComponent(new OccluderComponent()); // its bounds tree.addComponent(new OccluderComponent('alpha')); // its silhouette hut.addComponent(new OccluderComponent({ points: hutOutline })); // an outline of your own crate.addComponent(new OccluderComponent({ body: physics.body })); // its colliders ```",
        "The outline follows the node's transform. While the component is active it is registered with the scene's lighting system, exactly as if its source had been passed to Lighting.occludeFrom; when it is disabled, its node leaves the scene, or the scene is retained or ends, it is unregistered again."
      ],
      "importLine": "import { OccluderComponent } from '@codexo/exojs/lighting'",
      "sourceLink": null
    },
